{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14466","headline":"和尉迟侍郎夏杪闻蝉 · 戴叔伦","name":"和尉迟侍郎夏杪闻蝉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚人方苦热，柱史独闻蝉。\n晴日暮江上，惊风一叶前。\n荡摇清管杂，幽咽野风传。\n旅舍闻君听，无由更昼眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14466.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14466","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}